  "description": "***Winner of the Excellence Award at the 6th Mr. Blue Webtoon Contest***\n\nAfter being outed, Jin-eom, an actor of eight years, struggles to even land minor roles. One day, just like any other, he meets his new manager, Jung Jin-woo. But when Jin-eom looks at Jin-woo, he can’t help but be reminded of the ex-boyfriend who once abandoned him…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_injury_wz)",
